===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|herta|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*herdō}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}}  {{m|ine-pro|*kerdʰ-||file, row, herd}}. Cognate with {{etyl|en|-}} {{term|herd|lang=en}}, {{etyl|da|-}} and {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|hjord|lang=sv}}, Gothic {{term|𐌷𐌰𐌹𐍂𐌳𐌰|tr=hairda|lang=got}}.

